WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.250
There was a contest to see who could spit a watermelon seed the farthest.

2
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.730
You should have seen all the people who wanted to spit a watermelon seed!

3
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.690
And, it was pretty fun to watch.

4
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.910
But Ashley, the pet contests were the best.

5
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.330
There was a pet parade.

6
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.910
Lots of people walked with their dogs.

7
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.570
That sounds so fun.

8
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:32.510
But Anna, tell me, how did you win a pet contest without a pet?

9
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:39.030
Okay, the closest thing I have is my pet rock.

10
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.650
I know it’s silly, but I’ve had it since I was a little girl.

11
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:53.530
So, for a joke, I brought it to the fair.

12
00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:00.730
But then I was invited to enter the “One-of-Kind Pet” contest.

13
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.670
And I won!

14
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:09.970
Anna, only you could have won a pet contest with a pet rock.

15
00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.950
I should have brought Dublin.

16
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.730
He would’ve won a contest!

17
00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.070
It’s not very easy to win one of these.

18
00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:18.990
Does he have a costume?

19
00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.990
They had a costume contest.

20
00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:25.170
You should have seen this little girl.

21
00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.790
She and her dog wore matching princess costumes!

22
00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.430
Dublin doesn’t wear costumes.

23
00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:35.890
Does he know any tricks?

24
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:37.730
Come this way.

25
00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.850
Now, watch this.

26
00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:57.110
You caught it, Dublin!

27
00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.290
And you killed it!

28
00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.210
Good dog!

29
00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:06.050
Ashley, he could have won the Best Catch contest!

30
00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:08.270
Aw, good boy!

31
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.450
Ashley, pets are fun, aren’t they?

32
00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.150
Yes.

33
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.570
And they become part of your family.

34
00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.150
Ashley, I think I want a dog.

35
00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:19.550
No.

36
00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.330
I know I want a dog!

37
00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.250
It’s a big responsibility.

38
00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.670
You may want to spend time with a dog first.

39
00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.970
That is a great idea.

40
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.130
But where can I find a dog?

41
00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:41.450
You know, Anna, I have some shopping to do.

42
00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:45.310
Do you want to watch Dublin for a couple of hours?

43
00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:45.670
Yes!

44
00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.250
I would!

45
00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:49.110
I will take very good care of him!

46
00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.070
I know you will.

47
00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.490
Here’s his leash.

48
00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:52.950
Thank you.
